# build outputs and caches
Core/build/
Core/build-*/
Web/node_modules/
Web/dist/
Web/test-results/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.blend1
*.blend2

# Regenerated binary outputs: deterministic from the scripts in Art/Source and Tools/.
